          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Yehudi, nee Beneberaki, nee Gat-rimoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Me-yarkoni, nee Rakoni, nee yaamuudá' iisaapoó Yopárií tseewá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Dani yaamuuín kiwa hayóh, inooín nina slaqwarár ayé' ay baraá gixsár Leshemu, mukdá' kuri baál slaqwaraaro, múk baraadá' sleémeero kuri hhaamiís, gixsadá' kari hayóh, ngari aaliyé' umuú gixsadá' nguri warqeesiyé', nguri bayé' Dani, umuú taatoó tlahhay'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsaduuká' nee ayeemooine an kudá' taa ka'aás dír tlahhoó Dani ar harqoomoó tlahhay'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
