          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli yaamu sleémeero ka'amisuwo ngiwa hhe'és, aluuwo yaamaá Yoshua garmoó Nuni i aali ngiri slayé' baraá tla/angw'ín wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín nguri gixsaárí haniisiyé', tidá' inós aa waatlakweés ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'. Gixsadá' ka bay Timnat-sera, tidá' gawaá tlom'aá Efraímúwí dirii'. Yoshua gixsadá' gari /abeés tleehhamooro, iri baraadá' wa hoót.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
